{"title":"Common divisor","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A <b>common divisor</b> of two or more <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\"> integers</a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Divisor\" title=\"Divisor\">divisor</a> of all those integers.  For any <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integers</a>, there is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greatest_common_divisor\" title=\"Greatest common divisor\">greatest common divisor</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problems</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Introductory\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Introductory</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Intermediate\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Intermediate</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Common_divisor&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Introductory\">Introductory</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Common_divisor&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Introductory\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Find the greatest common divisor of 12, 99, and 111.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Intermediate\">Intermediate</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Common_divisor&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Intermediate\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Prove that the greatest common divisor of two numbers times the least <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Common_multiple\" title=\"Common multiple\">common multiple</a> of those two numbers is equal to the product of the two numbers.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Common_divisor&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclidean_algorithm\" title=\"Euclidean algorithm\">Euclidean algorithm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Common_multiple\" title=\"Common multiple\">Common multiple</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greatest_common_divisor\" title=\"Greatest common divisor\">Greatest common divisor</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018080831\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest exp